OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree talks resume at
OL,4,AHillsborough as residents' legal case
OL,5,Apostponed
OL,6,
OL,7,FMembers of the Portadown Orange Order
OL,8,Fand the Garvaghy Road Residents'
OL,9,FCoalition (GRRC) have arrived
OL,10,Fseparately at Hillsborough Castle for
OL,11,Ffurther talks on the Drumcree parading
OL,12,Fdispute.
OL,14,FThe Orange Order delegation included
OL,15,FNigel Dawson, district master in
OL,16,FPortadown, and loyalist activist Jamie
OL,17,FBryson who has been acting as their
OL,18,Flegal adviser.
OL,20,FGRRC chairman Breandan Mac Cionnaith
OL,21,Fsaid he did not know what to expect
OL,22,Ffrom the latest round of discussions.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
