OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree talks resume at
OL,4,AHillsborough as residents' legal case
OL,5,Apostponed
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Tuesday, lawyers for the GRRC issued
OL,8,Fa fresh legal bid to try to prevent the
OL,9,Fmarch from going ahead.
